}^{′}(-9,-3),$ as shown below.\n\n![](images/17/177ca7f40ef24cf2f45a15b78487700d1f0efd094c975079cf4704b46debefb1.png)" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393765 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393766 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393765 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393767 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393765 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393768 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393765 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393769 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393765 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393770 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393765 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393765 1077 "selection" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393765 1079 #edb/ref 17592186393770 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393765 1080 #uuid "34779380-003f-5fa8-8d6a-ad93873e4a0e" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393766 1081 "images/15/15134cfea5a58d0351be842c28d087a50591d60fb6a9f8ee36bcf4b35fb950ed.png" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393766 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393766 1084 #uuid "b8b95b62-9eac-5c79-b618-0298e1652616" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393767 1081 "images/e0/e055c227957074b5b8bb321cbc43f9c0f2796f7f7040616fe291098e9fd2dfb0.png" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393767 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393767 1084 #uuid "810f1d21-088a-52c7-8b34-c361d3749bb5" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393768 1081 "images/d6/d6e72adfafe111e75253f355d80d7d27c1a89bd2483c0db5618bee62c79f87ad.png" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393768 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393768 1084 #uuid "c597b2fb-5e49-5cfd-96c5-71b7925a4a9e" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393769 1081 "images/19/19dc7b72e149547ff51758dadf84f94be080a68227239e07239ce0659ade5a5a.png" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393769 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393769 1084 #uuid "988f9b48-24b5-5ff5-8b0b-4a4252631376" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393770 1081 "images/17/177ca7f40ef24cf2f45a15b78487700d1f0efd094c975079cf4704b46debefb1.png" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393770 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393770 1084 #uuid "2ecd37a8-72a0-57e0-80f3-347934775efa" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393771 1068 #edb/ref 17592186393772 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393771 1069 "q-7798" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393771 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393771 1071 "Solve the initial value problem\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}-8{y}^{′}+16y=0,\\,y(1)=2,\\text{ }\\text{ }{y}^{′}(1)=-1.\n$$" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393771 1072 #uuid "e0ccd8f3-5c55-5b1e-8569-1f7045c0f609" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393771 1074 "Let $y={e}^{\\lambda x}.$ Differentiating $y$ with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=\\lambda {e}^{\\lambda x},\\,{y}^{″}={\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda x}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into our differential equation gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda x}-8\\lambda {e}^{\\lambda x}+16{e}^{\\lambda x} & =0 \\\\ {e}^{\\lambda x}({\\lambda }^{2}-8\\lambda +16) & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe auxiliary equation is therefore\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}-8\\lambda +16 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFactoring the auxiliary equation gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(\\lambda -4)(\\lambda -4) & =0 \\\\ (\\lambda -4)^{2} & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\lambda =4$ is a repeated root.\n\nSo the general solution to the differential equation is\n\n$$\ny=A{e}^{4x}+Bx{e}^{4x}.\n$$\n\nLet us find constants $A$ and $B.$ \n\nSubstituting $y(1)=2$ into the general solution gives\n\n$$\nA{e}^{4}+B{e}^{4}=2.\n$$\n\nWe now need to apply the condition ${y}^{′}(1)=-1.$ First, we differentiate $y$ to find ${y}^{′}$:\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=4A{e}^{4x}+B{e}^{4x}+4Bx{e}^{4x}\n$$\n\nSubstituting ${y}^{′}(1)=1$ into the above gives\n\n$$\n4A{e}^{4}+5B{e}^{4}=-1.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have the following system of equations for $A$ and $B$:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}A{e}^{4}+B{e}^{4}=2 \\\\ 4A{e}^{4}+5B{e}^{4}=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSolving this system gives $A=11{e}^{-4},B=-9{e}^{-4}.$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =11{e}^{-4}\\cdot {e}^{4x}-9{e}^{-4}\\cdot x{e}^{4x} \\\\  & =11{e}^{4x-4}-9x{e}^{4x-4}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393772 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393773 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393772 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393774 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393772 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393775 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393772 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393776 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393772 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393777 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393772 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393772 1077 "selection" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393772 1079 #edb/ref 17592186393773 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393772 1080 #uuid "656ffe0f-9fb3-55a1-98b5-b13db8a4f14b" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393773 1081 "y=11{e}^{4x-4}-9x{e}^{4x-4}" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393773 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393773 1084 #uuid "eeaa8919-6cd1-523d-89da-7ef2030fd077" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393774 1081 "y=-7{e}^{4x-4}+9x{e}^{4x-4}" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393774 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393774 1084 #uuid "31ad293a-a2de-5b04-a010-75b1e574916b" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393775 1081 "y=5{e}^{4x-4}-3x{e}^{4x-4}" 13194139533465 17592186045