=d$ by $A,$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1}B\\,x & =d \\\\ A{A}^{-1}B\\,x & =A\\,d \\\\ {I}_{6}B\\,x & =A\\,d \\\\ B\\,x & =A\\,d.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $B$ is not singular, it must have an inverse ${B}^{-1}.$ Now, pre-multiplying both sides of the equation $B\\,x=A\\,d$ by ${B}^{-1},$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}B\\,x & =A\\,d \\\\ {B}^{-1}B\\,x & ={B}^{-1}A\\,d \\\\ {I}_{6}\\,x & ={B}^{-1}A\\,d \\\\ x & ={B}^{-1}A\\,d.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393905 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393906 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393905 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393907 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393905 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393908 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393905 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393909 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393905 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393910 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393905 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393905 1077 "selection" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393905 1079 #edb/ref 17592186393909 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393905 1080 #uuid "949387db-f0bb-576c-92cd-6be88553f987" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393906 1081 "x=A\\,d\\,{B}^{-1}" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393906 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393906 1084 #uuid "f188d035-264a-5a84-960f-7777553b0e05" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393907 1081 "x=BA\\,d" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393907 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393907 1084 #uuid "e9b99b9b-8aea-5b21-b666-f2b5972647d5" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393908 1081 "x=A{B}^{-1}\\,d" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393908 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393908 1084 #uuid "03b50807-020a-5cac-b35c-77e42daa0304" 13194139533465 1759218604558