\ {c}_{1}\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have a system of linear equations\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}4{c}_{1}+{c}_{2}=4 \\\\ {c}_{1}=3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the second equation, we obtain \n\n$$\n{c}_{1}=3.\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into the first equation, we obtain \n\n$$\n4\\cdot 3+{c}_{2}=4\\,⟹\\,{c}_{2}=-8.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, the solution for the initial value problem is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(t) & =3\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]{e}^{3t}+(-8)\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]{e}^{2t} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}12 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]{e}^{3t}+[\\begin{aligned}-8 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]{e}^{2t}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393968 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393969 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393968 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393970 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393968 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393971 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393968 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393972 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393968 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393973 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393968 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393968 1077 "selection" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393968 1079 #edb/ref 17592186393972 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393968 1080 #uuid "a2f43ed9-70b5-571a-9342-1d4d9a3e81be" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393969 1081 "x(t)=[\\begin{aligned}12 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]{e}^{4t}+[\\begin{aligned}-28 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]{e}^{2t}" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393969 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393969 1084 #uuid "30a1dfc9-55d7-539a-838d-044ac35e80d1" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186393970 1081 "x(t)=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]{e}^{3t}+[\\begin{aligned}-18 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]{e}^{2t}" 13194139533465 17592186045585 tr