∼[\\begin{aligned}-6 & -6 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn the reduced matrix above, there is one pivot column (the $1$st one). Thus, ${x}_{2}$ is a free variable. \n\nFrom the first equation, we obtain \n\n$$\n-6{x}_{1}-6{x}_{2}=0\\,⟹\\,{x}_{1}=-{x}_{2}.\n$$\n\nHence, the general solution is\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}],\\,{x}_{2}\\in R.\n$$\n\nFinally, setting ${x}_{2}=1,$ we get the eigenvector \n\n$$\nv=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394003 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394004 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394003 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394005 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394003 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394006 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394003 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394007 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394003 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394008 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394003 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394003 1077 "selection" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394003 1079 #edb/ref 17592186394006 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394003 1080 #uuid "6dc5d1e1-a9ac-55f4-97d3-5950006030fc" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394004 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394004 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394004 1084 #uuid "c57b3f88-81ed-58c4-9f8a-e3ad55ab73c7" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394005 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394005 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394005 1084 #uuid "09c64718-21b5-5183-bfa9-c8d620351a27" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394006 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394006 1083 #edb/ref 175921860454