ed}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}y{e}^{xy} & x{e}^{xy}\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the second partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}^{2}} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(y{e}^{xy})={y}^{2}{e}^{xy}\\, & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂x∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(x{e}^{xy})={e}^{xy}+xy\\,\\text{ }{e}^{xy} \\\\ \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂y∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(y{e}^{xy})={e}^{xy}+xy\\,\\text{ }{e}^{xy}\\, & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{y}^{2}} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(x{e}^{xy})={x}^{2}{e}^{xy}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nSo, the second derivative is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{″}(x,y) & =[\\begin{aligned}{y}^{2}{e}^{xy} & {e}^{xy}(1+xy) \\\\ {e}^{xy}(1+xy) & {x}^{2}{e}^{xy}\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394112 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394113 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394112 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394114 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394112 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394115 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394112 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394116 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394112 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394117 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394112 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394112 1077 "selection" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394112 1079 #edb/ref 17592186394114 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394112 1080 #uuid "bab53cf7-593b-54ae-b653-6ab7353d6f02" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394113 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}{y}^{2}{e}^{xy} & {e}^{xy} \\\\ {e}^{xy} & {x}^{2}{e}^{xy}\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394113 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394113 1084 #uuid "0e80e6d5-e332-5afa-ba42-d5007ebeac81" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394114 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}{y}^{2}{e}^{xy} & {e}^{xy}(1+xy) \\\\ {e}^{xy}(1+xy) & {x}^{2}{e}^{xy}\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394114 1083 #edb/ref 1