689-200704c459f2" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394132 1074 "A partition of a set $Y$ is a collection of non-empty subsets of $Y$ where every element of $Y$ is contained in *exactly* one subset. \n\nTo find the subset that goes in the blank, we must identify which elements of $Y$ are not yet contained within any of the given subsets.\n\nLet's go through each element of $Y$ and check:\n\n- $1\\in {1,16,36}\\,✓$\n\n- $6$ does not belong to any of the given subsets $\\,\\times $\n\n- $11\\in {11,31}\\,✓$\n\n- $16\\in {1,16,36}\\,✓$\n\n- $21$ does not belong to any of the given subsets $\\,\\times $\n\n- $26$ does not belong to any of the given subsets $\\,\\times $\n\n- $31\\in {11,31}\\,✓$\n\n- $36\\in {1,16,36}\\,✓$\n\nThe elements $6,$ $21,$ and $26$ are not yet contained within any of the given subsets. Therefore, the subset that must go in the blank is ${6,21,26}.$" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394133 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394134 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394133 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394135 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394133 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394136 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394133 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394137 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394133 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394138 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394133 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394133 1077 "selection" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394133 1079 #edb/ref 17592186394137 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394133 1080 #uuid "fa265d5f-8364-5414-8cf9-a381d1d7efc4" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394134 1081 "{6,11,26}" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394134 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394134 1084 #uuid "7c379a56-09a4-5ac9-965d-f7a539ca915a" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394135 1081 "{6,11,36}" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186