}_{1}-2{x}_{3}=0 \\\\ 4{x}_{1}-4{x}_{3}=0\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394174 1072 #uuid "76b489c8-5c8f-576c-ba37-1623ccf3438d" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394174 1074 "First, we need to find the basis of the solution space of the system.\n\nConsider the augmented matrix $M$ of the system, which we reduce to its row echelon form. Then\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 0 & -4 & 0\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn the reduced matrix above, there is $1$ pivot column (the $1$st one). Thus, ${x}_{2},\\,{x}_{3}$ are free variables. Now, from the first equation, we get ${x}_{1}={x}_{3}.$ Therefore, the general solution is\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}]={x}_{2}[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{3}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}],\\,{x}_{2},\\,{x}_{3}\\in R.\n$$\n\nConsequently, $B={[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}$ is the basis of the solution space of the system.\n\nNow, we find the orthogonal projection of $x$ onto the solution space of the system:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{S}\\,x & =A({A}^{T}\\,A)^{-1}\\,{A}^{T}\\,x \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot {([\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}])}^{-1}\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot {[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{aligned}]}^{-1}\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394175 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394176 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394175 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394177 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394175 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394178 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394175 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394179 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394175 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394180 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394175 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394175 1077 "selection" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394175 1079 #edb/ref 17592186394180 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394175 1080 #uuid "5f57172d-5f9c-5680-8423-f0e6ea5d7ffd" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394176 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394176 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394176 1084 #uuid "15dd4b81-6252-5a69-bca0-e1fd124cd255" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394177 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394177 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394177 1084 #uuid "b85664a1-3fab-583f-971d-9811e99660ae" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394178 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394178 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394178 1084 #uuid "11f43327-ed18-5f77-aef7-7e1056596fc5" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394179 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533465 17592186045585 