+5)^{2}=-(x-2)?$" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394619 1072 #uuid "4a1a945b-79bd-54e9-8bd1-4a820e9e7516" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394619 1074 "The standard equation of a left- or right-opening parabola that has its vertex at $(h,k)$ is\n\n$$\n(y-k)^{2}=4p(x-h),\n$$\n\nwhere $p$ is constant.\n\nWe can rewrite the given equation as \n\n$$\n(y+5)^{2}=4(-\\frac{1}{4})(x-2).\n$$\n\nIt is now clear that our equation is of the standard type with $p=-\\frac{1}{4}.$ \n\nComparing our equation with the standard equation, we can see that we have $h=2$ and $k=-5.$ Therefore, the coordinates of the vertex of the parabola are $(2,-5).$" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394620 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394621 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394620 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394622 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394620 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394623 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394620 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394624 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394620 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394625 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394620 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394620 1077 "selection" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394620 1079 #edb/ref 17592186394625 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394620 1080 #uuid "e066a708-3818-5b25-a57a-0121fdb30598" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394621 1081 "(\\frac{1}{4},-2)" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394621 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394621 1084 #uuid "2dc4323e-c33f-535a-afd4-6c18fb62876c" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394622 1081 "(5,-2)" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394622 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394622 1084 #uuid "2c600d3d-c6b3-5497-b45a-7300868b4cbd" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394623 1081 "(-\\frac{1}{4},-5)" 131941395