 [17592186394812 1072 #uuid "08d1c857-ad7f-54d3-8cc2-8674402a4da7" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394812 1074 "Recall the following:\n\n- a function $f(x)$ is *even* if $f(-x)=f(x)$\n\n- a function $f(x)$ is *odd* if $f(-x)=-f(x)$\n\nMoreover, for any even function $f(x),$ the graph of $y=f(x)$ is symmetric across the $y$-axis, so we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-a}^{a}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=2{\\int }_{0}^{a}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nNotice that $f(x)=-2{x}^{4}$ is an even function. Indeed, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(-x) & =-2(-x)^{4} \\\\  & =-2{x}^{4} \\\\  & =f(x).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, because $f(x)=-2{x}^{4}$ is an even function, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-5}^{5}(-2{x}^{4})\\,\\text{d}x=2{\\int }_{0}^{5}(-2{x}^{4})\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394813 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394814 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394813 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394815 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394813 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394816 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394813 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394817 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394813 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394818 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394813 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394813 1077 "selection" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394813 1079 #edb/ref 17592186394814 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394813 1080 #uuid "0119927c-a01d-5b78-a103-50404f248e3a" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394814 1081 "2{\\int }_{0}^{5}(-2{x}^{4})\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394814 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394814 1084 #uuid "f4569a67-9a9a-5c93-9c04-8f027738fd58" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394815 1081 "{\\int }_{0}^{10}(-2{x}^{4})\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394815 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [