=f(x).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, because $f(x)={x}^{3}\\operatorname{tan}⁡x$ is an even function, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-\\pi /4}^{\\pi /4}{x}^{3}\\operatorname{tan}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=2{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}{x}^{3}\\operatorname{tan}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394820 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394821 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394820 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394822 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394820 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394823 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394820 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394824 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394820 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394825 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394820 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394820 1077 "selection" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394820 1079 #edb/ref 17592186394821 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394820 1080 #uuid "7abae3bf-d10f-5c55-80f7-9c49ccf34f4a" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394821 1081 "2{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}{x}^{3}\\operatorname{tan}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394821 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394821 1084 #uuid "17c2ecf4-99f4-5dad-ab4f-910329c94dfe" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394822 1081 "{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}{x}^{3}\\operatorname{tan}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394822 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394822 1084 #uuid "b7fef5ff-24d7-5327-a103-82c357613c13" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394823 1081 "0" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394823 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394823 1084 #uuid "758abcaf-63e6-5073-89e4-0e3884143544" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394824 1081 "\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}{x}^{3}\\operatorname{tan}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394824 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394824 1084 #uuid "31097718-5ae5-59aa-bd91-30f505bad699" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394825 1081 "-{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}{x}^{3}\\operatorname{tan}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394825 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394825 1084 #uuid "7735ad99-af34-539c-b750-3bf5a3df7d82" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394826 1068 #edb/ref 17592186394827 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394826 1069 "q-89266" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394826 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394826 1071 "Simplify $(P∨Q)∨(Q∧Q).$" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394826 1072 #uuid "c8088540-0f2b-5602-b820-b1ed9dad2fb7" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394826 1074 "Using the associative and idempotent laws, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(P∨Q)∨(Q∧Q) & ≡(P∨Q)∨Q \\\\  & ≡P∨(Q∨Q) \\\\  & ≡P∨Q.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394827 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394828 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394827 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394829 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394827 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394830 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394827 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394831 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394827 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394832 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394827 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394827 1077 "selection" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394827 1079 #edb/ref 17592186394832 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394827 1080 #uuid "5bd8780b-5e12-55d9-bb80-be017170c855" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394828 1081 "Q∨(P∧Q)" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394828 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 1759218