nd inequality $y\\le -2x,$ we draw the corresponding straight line $y=-2x.$ \n\n- Since we have an \"or equal to\" inequality, the line itself is included in the solution, so the line is solid.\n\n- The inequality refers to the $y$-values that are *less than* or equal to those on the line, so we shade *below* the line.\n\nThe intersection of the solutions is the following:\n\n![](images/43/438928da5e9de5e9ba3d2abbe06b6f1f8b6b0598a0b82bec1f51824b9ef72a71.png)" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394834 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394835 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394834 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394836 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394834 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394837 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394834 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394838 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394834 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394839 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394834 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394834 1077 "selection" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394834 1079 #edb/ref 17592186394839 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394834 1080 #uuid "7c907422-6a43-51a3-a689-8ba380b4f66e" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394835 1081 "images/bb/bb0ea125af03527a6e3111fc638f5fd9a4efaa39bc7b48a82e2efcfcfb0b696b.png" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394835 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394835 1084 #uuid "338a182a-eee2-5984-9c16-ac8f5df92c94" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394836 1081 "images/27/27ba3ad2783e64a6b29d5ea488d63fc634d2a43ee01d6a77c4802da8bc06b641.png" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394836 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394836 1084 #uuid "3faab0ae-2527-51e9-960b-f170f93df96e" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394837 1081 "images/e5/e5428cead5e96d930e52a833942a1c4452c43f3e2f6ba7c6fc39758ee83e8d81.png" 13194139533465 175