erations.\n\nSince adding a multiple of one row (or column) to another row (column) in a matrix does not change the value of its determinant, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,|\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 & 4 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 5 & 2 \\\\ -3 & -1 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 5 & 2 & -1 & 1\\end{aligned}| &  & \\,\\begin{aligned}{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+3{R}_{1} \\\\ {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(-1){R}_{1} \\\\ {R}_{4}:={R}_{4}+2{R}_{1}\\end{aligned} \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 & 4 & 3 \\\\ 11 & 0 & 17 & 11 \\\\ -6 & 0 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 11 & 0 & 7 & 7\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the result along the $2$nd column, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,|\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 & 4 & 3 \\\\ 11 & 0 & 17 & 11 \\\\ -6 & 0 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 11 & 0 & 7 & 7\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(-1)\\cdot (-1)^{1+2}|\\begin{aligned}11 & 17 & 11 \\\\ -6 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 11 & 7 & 7\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}11 & 17 & 11 \\\\ -6 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 11 & 7 & 7\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394847 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394848 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394847 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394849 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394847 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394850 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394847 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394851 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394847 1075 #edb/ref 17592186394852 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394847 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394847 1077 "selection" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394847 1079 #edb/ref 17592186394848 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394847 1080 #uuid "be649d92-73f0-5810-94c6-ee526da83145" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394848 1081 "|\\begin{aligned}11 & 17 & 11 \\\\ -6 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 11 & 7 & 7\\end{aligned}|" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394848 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186394848 1084 #uuid "a1de9