st, let's denote the vectors of $B$ and $C$ as ${{b}_{1},{b}_{2}}$ and ${{c}_{1},{c}_{2}}$, respectively.\n\nThe change-of-coordinates matrix from $B$ to $C$ is a matrix whose columns are the coordinates of vectors from $B$ relative to the basis $C.$\n\nHence, we need to find the coordinates of ${b}_{1}$ and ${b}_{2}$ relative to the basis $C.$ To do this, we consider the matrix\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}| & | & | & | \\\\ {c}_{1} & {c}_{2} & {b}_{1} & {b}_{2} \\\\ | & | & | & |\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nWe reduce $M$ using Gaussian elimination until we get the identity matrix on the left. By doing this, we obtain the required change-of-coordinates matrix on the right.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -3 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 8 & -1 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-3){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 8 & -2\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :=\\frac{1}{2}{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 4 & -1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :={R}_{1}+(-2){R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & -11 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 4 & -1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence,\n\n$$\n{P}_{B\\to C}=[\\begin{aligned}-11 & 3 \\\\ 4 & -1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the inverse of ${P}_{B\\to C}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{B\\to C}^{-1} & ={[\\begin{aligned}-11 & 3 \\\\ 4 & -1\\end{aligned}]}^{-1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{(-1)\\cdot (-11)-4\\cdot 3}[\\begin{aligned}-1 & -3 \\\\ -4 & -11\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 \\\\ 4 & 11\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we can compute the matrix of $T$ relative to the basis $C:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[T]_{C} & ={P}_{B\\to C}\\cdot [T]_{B}\\cdot {P}_{B\\to C}^{-1} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-11 & 3 \\\\ 4 & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 \\\\ 4 & 11\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}20 & -6 \\\\ -7 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 \\\\ 4 & 11\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-4 & -6 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395263 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395264 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395263 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395265 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395263 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395266 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395263 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395267 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395263 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395268 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395263 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395263 1077 "selection" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395263 1079 #edb/ref 17592186395264 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395263 1080 #uuid "39e774e2-138b-5903-abec-0799b97f1fed" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395264 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}-4 & -6 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395264 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395264 1084 #uuid "0dba848e-8a50-579f-aa1a-cc8b6a92a123" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395265 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 \\\\ 4 & 11\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395265 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395265 1084 #uuid "8afbc7d4-59ea-5795-91f6-cca9cb7bb68f" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395266 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}-11 & -3 \\\\ -4 & 1\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395266 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395266 1084 #uuid "fd1c3f63-ca96-5f2f-8e18-b4ac0f1ec695" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395267 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}20 & -6 \\\\ -7 & 2\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395267 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395267 1084 #uuid "9a6b5e40-d27c-5a06-a89d-52b2c3b456f8" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [1759