atorname{sin}⁡4t\\,i+20\\operatorname{cos}⁡4t\\,j)^{′} \\\\  & =-80\\operatorname{cos}⁡4t\\,i-80\\operatorname{sin}⁡4t\\,j.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we find the acceleration vector at $t=\\frac{\\pi }{2},$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(\\frac{\\pi }{2}) & =-80\\operatorname{cos}⁡(4\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{2})\\,i-80\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{2})\\,j \\\\  & =-80\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2\\pi )\\,i-80\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\pi )\\,j \\\\  & =-80\\,i\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395330 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395331 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395330 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395332 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395330 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395333 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395330 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395334 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395330 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395335 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395330 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395330 1077 "selection" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395330 1079 #edb/ref 17592186395333 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395330 1080 #uuid "d30d24cc-d490-51a6-9670-d0e1ff6bece7" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395331 1081 "80\\,j" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395331 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395331 1084 #uuid "615b3966-ab34-54c4-94fb-2b6a493a05bf" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395332 1081 "-40\\,i-40\\,j" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395332 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395332 1084 #uuid "ba942577-688b-51be-af1b-e90b9481cd96" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395333 1081 "-80\\,i" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395333 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395333 1084 #uuid "2a94b620-9112-5178-8c25-19f0c2cb69b1" 13194139533465