}{\\text{d}t}(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(1)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t,\\,0⟩, \\\\ a(\\pi ) & =⟨-\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\pi ,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\pi ,\\,0⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1,\\,0,\\,0⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we compute $v(\\pi )\\cdot a(\\pi )$ and $||v(\\pi )||:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(\\pi )\\cdot a(\\pi ) & =⟨0,\\,1,\\,1⟩\\cdot ⟨1,\\,0,\\,0⟩ \\\\  & =0, \\\\ ||v(\\pi )|| & =\\sqrt{(0)^{2}+(1)^{2}+(1)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the tangential component of the acceleration at $t=\\pi ,$ and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{T} & =\\frac{v(\\pi )\\cdot a(\\pi )}{||v(\\pi )||} \\\\  & =\\frac{0}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\  & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the tangential component of the acceleration is $0\\,{\\text{ms}}^{-2}.$" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395337 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395338 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395337 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395339 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395337 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395340 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395337 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395341 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395337 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395342 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395337 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395337 1077 "selection" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395337 1079 #edb/ref 17592186395340 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395337 1080 #uuid "7b0f922d-a304-5edb-af59-b51332258ba6" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395338 1081 "2\\,{\\text{ms}}^{-2}" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395338 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395338 1084 #uuid "98e66298-a08d-5d19-86a9-54be284c9700" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395339 1081 "1\\,{\\text{ms}}^{-2}" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395339 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 