{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =-{\\int }_{2}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-⟨4,\\,-10,\\,-14⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-4,\\,10,\\,14⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, applying the scalar multiplication rule, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{1}{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot ⟨-4,\\,10,\\,14⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-2,\\,5,\\,7⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395451 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395452 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395451 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395453 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395451 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395454 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395451 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395455 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395451 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395456 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395451 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395451 1077 "selection" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395451 1079 #edb/ref 17592186395453 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395451 1080 #uuid "e1aae533-8d8a-5285-b8ff-9cc79c87f698" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395452 1081 "⟨4,\\,10,\\,14⟩" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395452 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395452 1084 #uuid "de2ac76c-9113-5a47-9157-727b5201bce3" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395453 1081 "⟨-2,\\,5,\\,7⟩" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395453 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395453 1084 #uuid "47e5a16a-fd42-59c9-8c7f-aefb666ddc96" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395454 1081 "⟨-4,\\,10,\\,14⟩" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395454 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395454 1084 #uuid "723d9e2a-b13f-5333-9e82-034a6fe25fc2" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395455 1081 "⟨-8,\\,15,\\,-7⟩" 13194139533465 17