7 1081 "images/43/43d4b05227a0667420e6978f01671931fb2392fe39692400407708edc8c24987.png" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395477 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395477 1084 #uuid "06ef197b-ec6b-5859-aeed-bb60ff22e391" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395478 1068 #edb/ref 17592186395479 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395478 1069 "q-98264" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395478 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395478 1071 "Calculate \n${\\int }_{1}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t$\ngiven that\n${\\int }_{1}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨-1,\\,-3,\\,5⟩$\nand\n${\\int }_{2}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨9,\\,-3,\\,-12⟩.$" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395478 1072 #uuid "aa70f714-feb6-5367-be2d-f3376c62dd97" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395478 1074 "Using the adjacent intervals rule, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{1}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{1}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{2}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nWe can rearrange the above as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{1}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{1}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{2}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t\n$$\n\nFinally, using the given information, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\int }_{1}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{2}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =⟨-1,\\,-3,\\,5⟩-⟨9,\\,-3,\\,-12⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-10,\\,0,\\,17⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395479 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395480 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395479 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395481 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395479 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395482 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395479 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395483 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395479 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395484 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395479 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395479 1077 "selection" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395479 1079 #edb/ref 17592186395481 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395479 1080 #uuid "78e07eb8-8447-541b-b561-a9c0ee6cb0da" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395480 1081 "⟨-10,\\,2,\\,5⟩" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395480 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395480 1084 #uuid "fbc5eff8-5991-5216-9466-5a5dbfc07458" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395481 1081 "⟨-10,\\,0,\\,17⟩" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395481 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395481 1084 #uuid "34e6e55b-5b33-57ca-8b1f-dd1819202d74" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395482 1081 "⟨-1,\\,0,\\,5⟩" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395482 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395482 1084 #uuid "cdcbb603-172f-5db6-a85f-15eb3e342ef2" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395483 1081 "⟨7,\\,1,\\,17⟩" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395483 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395483 1084 #uuid "430688b8-a0bb-5716-8d64-979ea5e3409d" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395484 1081 "⟨-1,\\,-7,\\,3⟩" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395484 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395484 1084 #uuid "0b607486-8990-56a3-98e2-8cf9c50c6fb2" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395485 1068 #edb/ref 17592186395486 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395485 1069 "q-98267" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395485 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395485 1071 "Calculate \n${\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t$\ngiven that\n${\\int }_{-3}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨4,\\,-2,\\,-8⟩$\nand\n${\\int }_{-3}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨-3,\\,0,\\,-2⟩.$" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395485 1072 #uuid "4d245661-e1e6-5225-8238-ac006910eb29" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395485 1074 "Using the adjacent intervals rule, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-3}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{-3}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nWe can rearrange the above as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{-3}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{-3}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t\n$$\n\nFinally, using the given information, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\int }_{-3}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{-3}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =⟨4,\\,-2,\\,-8⟩-⟨-3,\\,0,\\,-2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨7,\\,-2,\\,-6⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395486 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395487 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395486 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395488 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395486 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395489 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395486 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395490 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395486 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395491 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395486 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395486 1077 "selection" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395486 1079 #edb/ref 17592186395489 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395486 1080 #uuid "529ccb18-66d4-5388-9e21-c869c2e96d7f" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395487 1081 "⟨1,\\,-1,\\,-6⟩" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395487 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395487 1084 #uuid "8ca88354-8351-596d-b297-1265d64017b3" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395488 1081 "⟨-7,\\,2,\\,-3⟩" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395488 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395488 1084 #uuid "6392b624-edbf-5332-ae87-fc19189e03c6" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [175921863954