:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v & =[\\begin{aligned}7-3\\text{i} \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]={{[\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{\\text{Re}(v)}+\\text{i}{{[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{\\text{Im}(v)}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we can now construct $P:$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P & =[\\begin{aligned}| & | \\\\ \\text{Re}(v) & \\text{Im}(v) \\\\ | & |\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}7 & -3 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395623 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395624 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395623 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395625 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395623 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395626 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395623 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395627 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395623 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395628 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395623 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395623 1077 "selection" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395623 1079 #edb/ref 17592186395626 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395623 1080 #uuid "33f2e820-62a2-58a7-938e-d07a21adae88" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395624 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}7 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395624 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395624 1084 #uuid "5213c88c-facb-5418-8e63-52c97033d8ae" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395625 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 7\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395625 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395625 1084 #uuid "c0e82d0f-0293-5d6f-aad4-c3f011e15dc8" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395626 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}7 & -3 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533465 17592186045585 true] [17592186395626 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533465 175921860455